---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy — Stratagem Agency"
	description="How Stratagem Agency collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
>

	<!-- Hero -->
	<section class="bg-[#0a1228] pt-32 pb-16">
		<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
			<p class="text-blue-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Legal</p>
			<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-4">
				Privacy Policy
			</h1>
			<p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Effective as of November 8, 2023</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- Content -->
	<section class="py-16 bg-white">
		<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-gray-900 prose-p:text-gray-600 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-li:text-gray-600">

				<p>Our website address is: <strong>https://stratagem.agency</strong>. At Stratagem Agency, we take your privacy seriously. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and share your personal information when you interact with our website and services.</p>

				<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
				<p>We collect personal information when you visit our website, use our services, or contact us. This may include:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Information you provide directly, such as your name, email address, and company when you submit our contact form.</li>
					<li>Information automatically collected when you visit our website, including your IP address and browser information. This occurs when your browser requests web fonts from Google Fonts — no tracking cookies are set by this service.</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
				<p>We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Responding to your enquiries and providing our services.</li>
					<li>Communicating with you about our work, including updates and relevant content.</li>
					<li>Improving our website based on how visitors interact with it.</li>
					<li>Complying with legal obligations.</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Information Sharing</h2>
				<p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We use Resend (resend.com) to process contact form submissions — your submitted data is transmitted through their service to reach us. We do not use this data for any other purpose.</p>

				<h2>Cookies</h2>
				<p>This website does not set any cookies. We do not use analytics tools, advertising trackers, or session cookies. Your browser will make a request to Google's servers to load the Inter typeface used on this site; Google's privacy policy governs how that request is handled.</p>

				<h2>How Long We Retain Your Data</h2>
				<p>Contact form submissions are retained in our email inbox for as long as necessary to handle your enquiry. You may request deletion at any time by contacting us.</p>

				<h2>Your Rights</h2>
				<p>Under GDPR (if you are in the EU or EEA) and other applicable privacy laws, you have the right to:</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Access the personal data we hold about you.</li>
					<li>Request correction or deletion of your personal data.</li>
					<li>Object to or restrict how we process your data.</li>
					<li>Withdraw consent at any time where processing is based on consent.</li>
				</ul>
				<p>To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@stratagem.agency">privacy@stratagem.agency</a>.</p>

				<h2>Security</h2>
				<p>We employ industry-standard measures to protect the information you share with us. However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure.</p>

				<h2>Changes to this Policy</h2>
				<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We encourage you to review it periodically. The effective date at the top of this page indicates when it was last revised.</p>

				<h2>Contact Us</h2>
				<p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your information, please contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@stratagem.agency">privacy@stratagem.agency</a>.</p>

			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>
